      "title": {
        "en": "Empathetic guidance from compassionate clinicians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Families consistently praise Dr Eileen McCarthy and technician Marlee for their profound compassion, gentleness, and emotional support during end-of-life care. Pet owners describe feeling deeply comforted by the team's unhurried presence and kindness during heartbreaking farewells. Multiple reviewers emphasize that the team treated both pet and family with genuine empathy."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 18,
      "title": {
        "en": "Peaceful and dignified home farewells"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers express deep gratitude for the calm, peaceful manner in which their beloved dogs and cats were helped to pass at home. Clients note that pets remained relaxed in their familiar beds surrounded by family, avoiding clinical stress. Families highlight that every step of the euthanasia procedure was conducted with profound tenderness and complete respect."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle explanations and thoughtful preparation"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents appreciate that Dr McCarthy takes ample time over the phone and in person to explain the procedure, answer sensitive questions, and ensure families feel thoroughly prepared. Reviewers note that every step of the process is communicated gently without pressure, giving owners clarity and peace of mind during difficult palliative decisions."
      }
    }
  ],
